{"document/id":"law/351","document/type":"law","document/number":"351","document/title":"YÜKSEK ÖĞRENİM KREDİ VE YURT  HİZMETLERİ KANUNU","document/path":"data/canonical/laws/351-yuksek-ogrenim-kredi-ve-yurt-hizmetleri-kanunu","article/id":"law/351/article/34","article/type":"normal","article/no":"34","article/title":"Gelirler ve giderlerin gösterilmesi","article/path":"data/canonical/laws/351-yuksek-ogrenim-kredi-ve-yurt-hizmetleri-kanunu/articles/madde-034.md","text":"(Mülga: 2/7/2018-KHK-703/11 md.)"}
