{"document/id":"law/t3-657","document/type":"law","document/number":"657","document/title":"HARİTA GENEL MÜDÜRLÜĞÜ İLE İLGİLİ BAZI DÜZENLEMELER HAKKINDA KANUN","document/path":"data/canonical/laws/657-harita-genel-mudurlugu-ile-ilgili-bazi-duzenlemeler-hakkinda-kanun","article/id":"law/t3-657/article/5","article/type":"normal","article/no":"5","article/title":null,"article/path":"data/canonical/laws/657-harita-genel-mudurlugu-ile-ilgili-bazi-duzenlemeler-hakkinda-kanun/articles/madde-005.md","text":"Belediyeler, idarei hususiyeler ve bilumum müessesat ve eşhas tarafından\nhususi vesaitle yaptırılacak her türlü plan ve haritaların birer nüshası vesaiki lazimesiyle\nHarita Genel Müdürlüğüne tevdi edilir.3"}
{"document/id":"law/t3-657","document/type":"law","document/number":"657","document/title":"HARİTA GENEL MÜDÜRLÜĞÜ İLE İLGİLİ BAZI DÜZENLEMELER HAKKINDA KANUN","document/path":"data/canonical/laws/657-harita-genel-mudurlugu-ile-ilgili-bazi-duzenlemeler-hakkinda-kanun","article/id":"law/t3-657/article/6","article/type":"normal","article/no":"6","article/title":null,"article/path":"data/canonical/laws/657-harita-genel-mudurlugu-ile-ilgili-bazi-duzenlemeler-hakkinda-kanun/articles/madde-006.md","text":"(Mülga: 2/7/2018 – KHK-703/73 md.)"}
