{"document/id":"law/926","document/type":"law","document/number":"926","document/title":"Türk Silâhlı Kuvvetleri Personel Kanunu","document/path":"data/canonical/laws/926-turk-silhli-kuvvetleri-personel-kanunu","article/id":"law/926/article/7","article/type":"additional","article/no":"7","article/title":null,"article/path":"data/canonical/laws/926-turk-silhli-kuvvetleri-personel-kanunu/articles/ek-madde-007.md","text":"(Ek: 31/7/1970 – 1323/13 md.; Mülga : 3/7/1975 – 1923/52 md.)\n\nAskeri lise öğrencilerinin harçlıkları :"}
